			"reason": "The input is a committed declaration rather than a query over an empty tree, and its declared mode is reconciled with the derived state in both directions before any leg runs: a generated route tree at any depth, a framework-scope dependency in any manifest section, a source file that CALLS one of the two entry helpers, or a project that extends the shared base all fail a registry still saying skeleton, and a registry declaring a surface the tree does not carry fails too.",
